@startuml 23_seq_host_detail
actor Operator
participant Flutter as UI
participant FastAPI as API
database SQLite as DB
Operator -> UI : Select host
par Host details
 UI -> API : GET /hosts/{id}
 API -> DB : current host + sample
 DB --> API : data
 API --> UI : host detail
else History series
 UI -> API : GET /hosts/{id}/history?window=1h
 API -> DB : select bounded time range
 DB --> API : samples
 API --> UI : chart points
else Top processes
 UI -> API : GET /hosts/{id}/processes
 API -> DB : latest snapshot
 DB --> API : up to 10 entries
 API --> UI : processes
end
@enduml
